    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPACE WALK</strong> puts you in the role of a lone astronaut living aboard <strong>A.S.T.R.A. Station</strong>, your home among the stars. As part of ASTRA\u2019s pioneering program, you\u2019ll explore the wonders of our solar system\u2014surveying distant landscapes, analyzing celestial phenomena, and uncovering the mysteries of the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the quiet vastness of space to the alien beauty of planetary surfaces, <strong>SPACE WALK</strong> offers a deeply immersive experience where every discovery is hands-on. Deploy research equipment, navigate low-gravity environments, and adapt to the challenges of each world you visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a focus on exploration and environmental storytelling, <strong>SPACE WALK</strong> invites you to carve out a life beyond Earth. Every journey brings new sights, untold stories, and the promise of discovery in the endless frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Exploration:\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the wonders of our solar system, from the lunar surface to the rings of Saturn. Traverse uncharted landscapes, witness breathtaking cosmic phenomena, and experience the vastness of space like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/cab24dbfb76e662066b1883586c8044c.poster.avif?t=1753098184\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/cab24dbfb76e662066b1883586c8044c.webm?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/cab24dbfb76e662066b1883586c8044c.mp4?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside the station, you\u2019ll float in zero gravity, while artificial gravity keeps you steady inside. Every planet has its own unique pull, from the Moon\u2019s light gravity to the immense forces of gas giants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/0b428b3afcf1141d0686202b59e2b38f.poster.avif?t=1753098184\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/0b428b3afcf1141d0686202b59e2b38f.webm?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/0b428b3afcf1141d0686202b59e2b38f.mp4?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Place To Call Home:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fabricator lets you personalize your station with decorations and utilities. From essential gear to personal touches, make your station feel like home as you explore the solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/f56dc9f4b6ae1b495f142afafea10ec0.poster.avif?t=1753098184\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/f56dc9f4b6ae1b495f142afafea10ec0.webm?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/f56dc9f4b6ae1b495f142afafea10ec0.mp4?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Physics Environment:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost every object can be interacted with. Perform hands-on tasks, operate machinery, and experience the challenge of managing a dynamic physics-based environment, where low and zero gravity add unique complexities to every action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/d1f15a02b7ca3e094e46272473fcb73a.poster.avif?t=1753098184\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/d1f15a02b7ca3e094e46272473fcb73a.webm?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/d1f15a02b7ca3e094e46272473fcb73a.mp4?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Station Maintenance:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure A.S.T.R.A Station remains functional by handling repairs, system reboots, and calibrations. From managing solar panels to overseeing life support, your efforts are essential to keeping the station operational.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/9d4d70899d74d86661897e48bd036358.poster.avif?t=1753098184\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/9d4d70899d74d86661897e48bd036358.webm?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/9d4d70899d74d86661897e48bd036358.mp4?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools And Equipment</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate the station and the planetary surfaces, you\u2019ll discover a variety of tools essential for survival and deeper exploration. Each tool offers unique ways to interact with your environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/0a71291134a469358706184be3d5d493.poster.avif?t=1753098184\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/0a71291134a469358706184be3d5d493.webm?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/0a71291134a469358706184be3d5d493.mp4?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
