/f56dc9f4b6ae1b495f142afafea10ec0.mp4?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Physics Environment:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost every object can be interacted with. Perform hands-on tasks, operate machinery, and experience the challenge of managing a dynamic physics-based environment, where low and zero gravity add unique complexities to every action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/d1f15a02b7ca3e094e46272473fcb73a.poster.avif?t=1753098184\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/d1f15a02b7ca3e094e46272473fcb73a.webm?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/d1f15a02b7ca3e094e46272473fcb73a.mp4?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Station Maintenance:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure A.S.T.R.A Station remains functional by handling repairs, system reboots, and calibrations. From managing solar panels to overseeing life support, your efforts are essential to keeping the station operational.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/9d4d70899d74d86661897e48bd036358.poster.avif?t=1753098184\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/9d4d70899d74d86661897e48bd036358.webm?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/9d4d70899d74d86661897e48bd036358.mp4?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools And Equipment</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate the station and the planetary surfaces, you\u2019ll discover a variety of tools essential for survival and deeper exploration. Each tool offers unique ways to interact with your environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/0a71291134a469358706184be3d5d493.poster.avif?t=1753098184\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/0a71291134a469358706184be3d5d493.webm?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310910/extras/0a71291134a469358706184be3d5d493.mp4?t=1753098184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
