        "notes": "SPACE WALK contains themes of isolation, survival, and existential dread, with moments designed to evoke tension and unease. Players may encounter situations involving injury (e.g., concussions, limb damage) and environmental hazards that contribute to a sense of peril. Its dark and mysterious atmosphere, combined with certain story elements, may be unsettling to some players. I recommend this game for mature audiences who are comfortable with thriller and suspense themes."
